Third-party code redistributed by this project
----------------------------------------------

The GitHub Pages site publishes js/vendor/esp-flash.js, an ESM bundle built by
esbuild from esp-web-tools and its dependencies, so that the web installer can
drive the low-level flashing engine without resolving it from a CDN at page
load. The third-party code in that bundle is unmodified: it is only assembled
and minified. Nothing else in this repository redistributes third-party code.

  esp-web-tools  10.4.0  Apache-2.0        https://github.com/esphome/esp-web-tools
  esptool-js     0.6.1   Apache-2.0        https://github.com/espressif/esptool-js
  atob-lite      2.0.0   MIT               https://github.com/hughsk/atob-lite
  pako           2.2.0   MIT AND Zlib      https://github.com/nodeca/pako

Their full licence texts are published alongside the bundle, as
js/vendor/esp-flash.LICENSES.txt. That file is assembled at deploy time from
the exact versions bundled, so it can never describe versions other than the
ones actually shipped (see .github/workflows/pages.yml).

tslib is also pulled in by that dependency chain. It is under 0BSD, which
requires no notice to be retained, so it is not listed above.
